<title>ESTONIA: GUTTA AND OLAINFORM TO GET LISTING IN SUMMER.</title>
<headline>GUTTA AND OLAINFORM TO GET LISTING IN SUMMER.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-04-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hansa Investments hopes to get a listing for Latvian juice producer Gutta and drug company Olainform on the Riga stock exchange in the summer, the company said on Friday.</p>
<p>&quot;We hope to get Gutta listed in the third quarter or during the summer,&quot; executive director, John Wilson, told Reuters.</p>
<p>Hansa Investments is also working getting a listing for one of the biggest pharmaceutical companies in Latvia, Olainform, he added.</p>
<p>&quot;We hope to get the company listed in June,&quot; he said.</p>
<p>&quot;Riga stock exchange has started slowly...and to be successful, it needs interesting companies,&quot; he said.</p>
<p>-- Eva Palu, Tallinn newsroom, +372 630 8400, reuters@reuters.ee</p>
</text>
